<title>USA: Warren BA, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Warren BA, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co. said it won $4.500 million of Warren Building Authority, Mich., 1997 building authority lease rental revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.9897 percent.</p>
</text>
